0052:     """Move each marked L-shaped sprite onto the separate pixel matching its marker color.
0053: 
0054:     Input structure
0055:     - The background is the dominant color.
0056:     - Foreground has 4-connected multicolor sprites and isolated one-pixel controls.
0057:     - Each sprite has one repeated body color in an L shape plus one embedded marker
0058:       pixel of a different color.
